date-released: 2026-07-17
url: "https://github.com/Apipilikas/scattered-directive-energy-monitoring"
abstract: >-
  This software integrates an energy monitoring pipeline into the Scattered Directive, 
  a distributed digital data marketplace that enforces dynamic policies within Vertical Federated Learning (VFL) workflows. 
  Built to study energy consumption behavior across both local and distributed execution environments such as the FABRIC testbed, 
  the pipeline detects system anomalies and computational bottlenecks. Through root cause analysis, the project introduces a 
  core architectural mitigation: transitioning policy reverification from a redundant poll-driven model to an event-driven one. To further evaluate the environmental impact of VFL, 
  the codebase implements and evaluates three additional mitigation strategies focused on communication efficiency and data privacy.
